   "chunk_id": "hc-nhpid-aloe-topical-topique2#002",
   "text": "Use(s) or Purpose(s): Used in Herbal Medicine to help relieve minor burns including sunburn (Barnes et al. 2007; Williamson 2003).\nUsed in Herbal Medicine to assist healing of minor wounds such as cuts and burns, and minor skin irritations (Barnes et al. 2007; Boon and Smith 2004; Williamson 2003; WHO 1999; Fulton 1990).",
   "section": "indications",
   "assertion_type": "efficacy",
