   "words": 53
  },
  {
   "chunk_id": "hc-nhpid-aloe-topical-topique2#003",
   "text": "Subpopulation(s): Children 2 to 11 years; Adolescents 12 to 17 years; Adults 18 years and older (McIntyre 2005; Bove 2001).",
